      <title>Soma 1.0 (571)</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:04:12 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>571</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Soma 1.0 (571)</h3><ul>
<li>Backups now appear in the Log (made, failed, and old ones removed), and Cortex can answer questions about them. Bullets no longer jump a space when you start typing. Shift-Up and Shift-Down now show the selection in notes.</li>
</ul><p>Soma is still in beta testing. Keep backups on (Settings › Backups).</p>]]></description>
