      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Soma 1.0 (529)</h3><ul>
<li>The first build that updates itself: Soma › Check for Updates…, and Settings › General › Updates.</li>
<li>Help: the user guide inside Soma (Help › Soma Help, ⌘?).</li>
<li>Link to a note from any notes box by typing [[.</li>
</ul><p>Soma is still in beta testing. Keep backups on (Settings › Backups).</p>]]></description>
